Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮小姐  到时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在是在和我说话哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.15,0:00:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长在等她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就没关系了  就一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说是很重要的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我和他说一声
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就等5分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.97,0:00:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:36.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天到这里就…结束了的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还需要…做点什么好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.15,0:00:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请自便
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.47,0:01:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你啊  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去散步吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.66,0:01:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  不小心聊入迷了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给您的身体带来不必要的压力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没到？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉  现在就去  再…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都要睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么…你是骑车…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我是用跑的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骑车是禁止带人的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.09,0:04:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体暖和了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气喘吁吁的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为…这是因为…谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人独处的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会起色心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.03,0:04:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  重要的话是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  很重要的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有请
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:04:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看得好清楚啊  星星
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真清楚我今天会去学校
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你和由绮说的吗  让她来大学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.87,0:05:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  又不知道她的联络方式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是多亏了你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我有祈过愿  希望冬弥能见到由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛  原来这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.11,0:06:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别回头哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说了声请自便
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后简直难以置信  真的就不见人了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:06:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概不会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就叫出租车了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装也化了  临时应付一下的话我觉得足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是总觉得司机的样子很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老是从后视镜里看来看去的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然就说「在电视台录节目吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:18.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最初是无视掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「新曲什么时候发售」「经常一个人回家吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在是不能让他送到家门口
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好到这附近  于是就下车了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以今晚就让我住在这吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.11,0:07:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会打扰你工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮也在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就两个人一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在原来我的房间…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理奈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮…怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么在哭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理…奈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮  我说  光哭的话我也不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  突然就走开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:08:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是定好的吗  每人做一天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧  不会少了你的薪水的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是客人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  客人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人  是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混合咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请自便哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,服务真差  还得自己动手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彰  你又开始做了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个  真怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手艺没变差嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  外观是没变
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店长  你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙听说美咲喜欢芝士蛋糕…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.57,0:10:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在劳技课的时间偷偷溜到女生的家政课想偷学手艺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都听好多次了  之后被你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被老师抓住  狠狠教训了一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.97,0:10:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使这样还是再犯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差点要被停学了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:36.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果叔叔…店长没说那句话的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「这里尽管使用吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是第一号实验体吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是抱歉了  抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是味道不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始就挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:54.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下工夫的方式不同吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该说是骨气么  还是执念
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请说成才能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是爱情…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知不觉就成了这家店的名产了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.55,0:11:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮直到现在都还相信着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是店长亲手制作的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天晚上的电话里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打来了吗  电话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  说是为什么不做蛋糕了呢  她还想吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.61,0:11:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明那么努力地学习做蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就坦白点  开心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:40.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进了大学就突然不做了  为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了冬弥  发烧…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:47.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你发现了这和你的初衷不符了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进了大学稍微成熟点了吧  杰生君
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:54.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不明白你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:12:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美咲什么都不知道就吃了  还是花钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么没给她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天她请假了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么美咲请假了  生病还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家里发生争执了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.87,0:12:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.39,0:12:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.91,0:12:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓我一跳  今天休息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  只是录节目前还有点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  那学校…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为要录节目所以请假
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥君呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为要打工所以请假
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了  闷死了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绪…绪方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是绪方理奈  你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.27,0:13:39.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真怀念  一点都没变啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次来的话一定要吃这个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.21,0:13:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗  太羡慕你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由绮…也对  真可怜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡路里限制
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太伤心了  难得复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.18,0:14:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复活？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉  这是今日限定的特别商品
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的女神的光顾纪念
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彰君  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.52,0:14:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊  由绮是他的女神嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.91,0:14:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢招待了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对不对不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我？  为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才第一次来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他的心里已经决定好了  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有趣的样子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙不管手脚还是脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全身上下各个部位都是由各种女性的一时兴起构造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不太清楚啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要在意  只是我擅自那么认为的而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  那么我今天造了你的什么部位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟然会认真考虑这种问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:14:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.37,0:14:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我  放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥  电话啦电话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无懈可击  正好5分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.99,0:15:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的经纪人在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理奈也一起怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方向又不同
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.03,0:15:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢款待了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学习？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个吗  是借来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前辈借给我写报告参考用的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告啊  学生真辛苦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可做不来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理…绪方小姐的工作更辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:29.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布朗宁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.77,0:16:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哥哥的书架上见过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绪方英二先生会参考这种书来作曲什么的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不太清楚  不过经常往墙壁上砸去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.01,0:16:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「真没用」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.19,0:16:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:16:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？  理奈你在这啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.72,0:17:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不是要录「歌之星空」的节目吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接送还没来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真拿他没办法啊  那年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你送我去吧  反正闲着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里是不能停车的  到门口自己跳下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也拜托你可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.74,0:17:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记我的帐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎  光临
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那  那个  歌手绪方理奈来这里了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的话刚刚…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:19.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？可是她说在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人看到哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藤井君？  我还以为说大学的朋友是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.39,0:18:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.95,0:18:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说你今天请假了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就打电话给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是就这个而已  也想谢谢你借我书
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我才要道谢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在通话没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是感冒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.07,0:19:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉  没什么大碍啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上稍微有点发烧  已经退了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是想偷懒而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那还是赶紧去睡觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事啦  再聊聊天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.57,0:19:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这是藤井君打过来的吧  电话费很贵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.45,0:19:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  钱用了一半的电话卡到处都是  正好想用掉它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  有关布朗宁…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何  有什么感触吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:19:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.75,0:20:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然才读了开头的几首
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是那种不反复读几次的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢  就无法联想到意境的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然明白大意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  能再借一会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.43,0:20:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以  随便你什么时候还
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好看完  告诉我感想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  我有事拜托藤井君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧  还是就说到这吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  今天还是算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  下次在大学里能拜托你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点好起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是呢  你明明身体不舒服还让你陪我聊这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴呢  多亏了你让我精神起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感冒已经好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行哦  好好睡觉  快好起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法啦  都被由绮她们吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我靠这些熬日子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.66,0:22:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是藤井家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.13,0:22:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬弥在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.31,0:22:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是绪方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是理奈
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预告：
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.95,0:24:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三页
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.58,0:24:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵手  肩并肩  背靠背
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.58,0:24:26.95,DefaultJP,NTP,0,0,0,,手と手、肩と肩、背中と背中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.89,0:24:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有  哪怕隔着衣服也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.89,0:24:31.54,DefaultJP,NTP,0,0,0,,それから 服の上からだっていいんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.48,0:24:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,White  Album
